@startuml task-statechart
!include _style.puml

[*] --> Todo : create

Todo --> Active : start\n[project not archived,\nno open work session of the developer]
Active --> Paused : pause\n[resume point given]
Paused --> Active : resume\n[project not archived,\nno open work session of the developer]
Active --> Completed : complete
Paused --> Completed : complete
Completed --> [*]

Todo : entry / status = todo
Active : entry / open work session
Active : exit / close work session
Paused : entry / store resume point
Completed : entry / set completed_at

note bottom of Active
  Switching is not a transition of its own. It is
  the pause of one task followed by the start of
  another in a single transaction, so both
  transitions must succeed together or not at all.
end note

@enduml
